necropolis-journal-text = The ink has run in places, but some of it is still legible.
    "...third week down here and the tendrils keep growing back no matter how many we burn. Command wants another sample before they'll authorize the next supply drop.
    Something took Hendricks last night. We heard Legion before we saw it - that chorus of skulls is enough to put anyone off their sleep schedule. We're rationing crusher charges now.
    If anyone finds this and the chest is still sealed - whatever's inside, it isn't worth what we paid for it. Take the loot and go."

